6. Bundled example expression data (NCBI GEO)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:
  public/files/GSE5281-expression.csv,  public/files/GSE5281-group.csv
  public/files/GSE84422-expression.csv, public/files/GSE84422-group.csv
  public/files/GSE48350-expression.csv, public/files/GSE48350-group.csv

  Derived from public NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) series:
    GSE5281  — https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE5281
    GSE84422 — https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE84422
    GSE48350 — https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE48350

  Included as example inputs. Please cite the original submitters when using
  these datasets in published work.

  The remaining sample inputs distributed with the application —
  public/files/ora-sample.txt and public/files/pgsea-sample.tsv — are small
  illustrative inputs shipped for demonstration purposes only; they are not
  intended as a citable dataset.


