7. Reference data NOT included in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The pathway and annotation databases IPSA analyses against are downloaded at
runtime from their upstream providers, or supplied by the operator. They are
not redistributed here, and each carries its own terms of use:

  KEGG         https://www.kegg.jp/kegg/legal.html
  Gene Ontology  http://geneontology.org/docs/go-citation-policy/
  Reactome     https://reactome.org/license
  MitoCarta    https://www.broadinstitute.org/mitocarta
               (Human.MitoCarta3.0.csv / Mouse.MitoCarta3.0.csv must be
                obtained from the Broad Institute and placed in .data/mitocarta)
  UniProt      https://www.uniprot.org/help/license
  NCBI Gene    https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/
  Harmonizome  https://maayanlab.cloud/Harmonizome/about

See README.md for how to provision each of these.
